  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c55978b8-7626-5815-88ad-e345c53299a9" activityNameId="3c2ac2e3-ed81-5851-b492-3128e0f55239" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, pellets, allocation exergy, at stirling cogen unit 3kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, pellets, allocation exergy, at stirling cogen unit 3kWe, future
The multioutput-process 'wood pellets, burned in Stirling cogen unit 1kWe, future" delivers the coproducts 'heat, pellets, allocation exergy, at Stirling cogen unit 3kWe, future' and 'electricity, pellets, allocation exergy, at Stirling cogen unit 3kWe, future'. The exergy allocation is the allocation scheme suggested to be used within the ecoinvent database (e.g. in electricity mixes).;
UUID: 3f4b8535-aabe-3f4a-9309-24586c54f913
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and working materials for operation.
Location: Wood pellet input modelled for Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Stirling motor for combustion of wood pellets. Power range: 1-3 kW electrical output, 4.5-10.5 kW heat output. Includes pellet storage volume for one day of operation. Electrical efficiency 23%, total efficiency 90%. Performance and lifetime according to expected future values for a serial product. Emission values based on similar processes and assumptions due to yet missing emission measurements.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3f4b8535-aabe-3f4a-9309-24586c54f913.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Wood pellet input modelled for Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Stirling motor for combustion of wood pellets. Power range: 1-3 kW electrical output, 4.5-10.5 kW heat output. Includes pellet storage volume for one day of operation. Electrical efficiency 23%, total efficiency 90%. Performance and lifetime according to expected future values for a serial product. Emission values based on similar processes and assumptions due to yet missing emission measurements.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2000-01-01" endDate="2005-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
